 "Sem tons teus: o tom por defeito do DLC Builder (Lead/Combo: Marshall Plexi; Rhythm: Orange AD50).": "No tones of your own: DLC Builder’s default tone (Lead/Combo: Marshall Plexi; Rhythm: Orange AD50).",
